          "claim_type": "factual",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "text": "Martin Griffiths, undersecretary general for Humanitarian Affairs, tweeted about Ukraine today saying, remember Ukraine? We do. People continue to face death and displacement as homes, hospitals and schools are destroyed.",
