              "evidence_subtype": "government_statement",
              "source_entity": "Martin Griffiths, undersecretary general for Humanitarian Affairs",
              "is_named": true,
              "is_primary": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yemen was one of those few, perhaps the only place in the world where we all had some hopes of real peace, after six or seven years of terrible war.",
